{
	quest.07F4512FBAB4242B.quest_desc: [
		"Nine Craft's own storage mod grows from a few cells to unlimited storage with autocrafting, all on one ore. See the §5Grim Storage Industries§r chapter."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Network Controller and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in. §7(Optional: you can skip this one.)§r"
	]
	quest.07F4512FBAB4242B.title: "Grim Storage"
	quest.07F6B64C4671720E.quest_desc: [
		"A maxed backpack and a drawer wall. Ready for AE2 or Refined Storage."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Netherite Backpack, Stack Upgrade Tier 4 and Storage Controller and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.07F6B64C4671720E.title: "Storage Sorted"
	quest.095B396E4D18CFB7.quest_desc: [
		"Massive stacks in every slot."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Stack Upgrade Tier 4 and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.095B396E4D18CFB7.title: "Stack Upgrade IV"
	quest.0A753369CDE4AE50.quest_desc: [
		"A full storage network is a mid-game project. Until then, these blocks keep your base tidy and your inventory light."
		""
		"This chapter covers Sophisticated Storage chests, Functional Storage drawers, Tom's Simple Storage terminals and Sophisticated Backpacks. Grab a few chests to start."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 4 x Chest and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
